  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to IFRC Emergency Appeal for Sri Lanka Cyclone Ditwah</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to IFRC Emergency Appeal for Sri Lanka Cyclone Ditwah focused on the delivery of WASH, shelter, relief items, medical and cash assistance to around 500,000 people across the most severely affected districts of Sri Lanka, prioritising those who are displaced or returning to damaged homes.  The funding will be channelled through the British Red Cross (BRC) and include a small contribution to support BRC deploy experts to reinforce SLRCS&#x2019;s capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
